    "title": "44th Annual Downtown Festival & Art Show on tap this weekend - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Reports ,\n8 hours ago The 44th Annual Downtown Festival & Art Show is slated for Saturday and Sunday, Nov. 14-15, in Gainesville. The event will run from 10 a.m. to 5 p.m. both days at 111 E. University Ave. and will feature more than 200 local and national artists showcasing their creations, from handcrafted jewelry to paintings, ceramics, photography and more, all available for purchase. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
